    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #290\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed successfully to branch `bb/relay-106-inbox-pipeline-07-07-render-inbox-item-thr_88c3ic8mqn`.\n\n## Summary\n\nPushed the review-response commit for PR #290 (issue #106, \"Render Inbox items inside Journal days\"). Since the remote branch had picked up a `develop` merge in the meantime, I rebased my commit on top of it before pushing — build and full test suite (backend 322/322, web 79/79) re-verified clean after the rebase.\n\nThis push addresses the automated code review's findings:\n- **Medium finding (architecture)**: `computedKeyRegistry.add(JOURNAL_INBOX_COMPUTED_KEY)` was only reached inside a one-time seed path skipped after first startup; hoisted to `seedSystem.ts`'s top level so the collision guard is declared on every process start.\n- **Medium finding (test coverage)**: added a test covering the revise-triggered cache invalidation path.\n- **Acceptance-criteria gaps**: registered a real `JournalInboxList` frontend renderer under the `journalInboxList` client component, added en/cs i18n catalog entries for the view's states and canonical proposal statuses, and made `journalDayItemId` part of the view's own config so it's actually renderable.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
