    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #290\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed successfully to branch `bb/relay-106-inbox-pipeline-07-07-render-inbox-item-thr_88c3ic8mqn`.\n\n## Summary\n\nPushed the latest review-response commit for PR #290 (issue #106, \"Render Inbox items inside Journal days\"). The remote branch had picked up another `develop` merge (including PR #289's soft-delete/partition-pruning fix) since my last push, so I rebased my commit on top before pushing — build and full test suite re-verified clean after the rebase (backend 26/26 files, 324/324 tests; web typecheck clean, 9/9 files, 81/81 tests).\n\nThis push addresses the automated code review's remaining blocking findings:\n- **HIGH**: `JournalInboxList.tsx` cast the cached `computed` payload without runtime validation. Added a Zod schema (`journalInboxItemSummarySchema`/`journalInboxItemListSchema`) and parse it inside the async loader, so a malformed payload surfaces through the existing error/retry UI instead of rendering garbage.\n- **MEDIUM**: added a test covering the error-state/retry branch and the new schema-validation failure path.\n- Also cleaned up a flagged low-priority comment in `inboxTickAction.ts` that mischaracterized which invalidation trigger the tick-driven recompute call actually covers.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
